Read the marked points to complete a table for $x=0,1,2,3$. Which table matches the graph?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\definecolor{relationshipBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridGrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\begin{axis}[width=7cm,height=6cm,axis lines=middle,axis line style={black,->},xmin=-0.5,xmax=3.6,ymin=-0.8,ymax=9,xtick={0,1,2,3},ytick={0,2,4,6,8},grid=major,grid style={gridGrey},scaled ticks=false,ticklabel style={font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont,text=black},label style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},xlabel={$x$},ylabel={$y$}]
\addplot[relationshipBlue,thick,<->,domain=-0.3:3.4,samples=2] {2*x+1};
\addplot[black,only marks,mark=*,mark size=1.8pt] coordinates {(0,1) (1,3) (2,5) (3,7)};
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

$A=\begin{array}{c|cccc}x&0&1&2&3\\\hline y&1&3&5&7\end{array}$

$B=\begin{array}{c|cccc}x&0&1&2&3\\\hline y&1&2&3&4\end{array}$

Which equation matches the graph: $y=-2x+5$ or $y=-x+5$?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\definecolor{relationshipBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridGrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\begin{axis}[width=7cm,height=6cm,axis lines=middle,axis line style={black,->},xmin=-0.5,xmax=3.6,ymin=-2,ymax=6,xtick={0,1,2,3},ytick={-2,-1,0,1,2,3,4,5,6},grid=major,grid style={gridGrey},scaled ticks=false,ticklabel style={font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont,text=black},label style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},xlabel={$x$},ylabel={$y$}]
\addplot[relationshipBlue,thick,<->,domain=-0.3:3.3,samples=2] {-2*x+5};
\addplot[black,only marks,mark=*,mark size=1.8pt] coordinates {(0,5) (1,3) (2,1) (3,-1)};
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Find the equation represented by the graph.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}
\definecolor{relationshipBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{gridGrey}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\begin{axis}[width=7cm,height=6.5cm,axis lines=middle,axis line style={black,->},xmin=-1.5,xmax=3.5,ymin=-5,ymax=6,xtick={-1,0,1,2,3},ytick={-4,-2,0,2,4,6},grid=major,grid style={gridGrey},scaled ticks=false,ticklabel style={font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont,text=black},label style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},xlabel={$x$},ylabel={$y$}]
\addplot[relationshipBlue,thick,<->,domain=-1.3:3.3,samples=2] {-2*x+2};
\addplot[black,only marks,mark=*,mark size=1.8pt] coordinates {(-1,4) (0,2) (1,0) (2,-2) (3,-4)};
\end{axis}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
